{
  "title": "Ziyarat of the Imams of al-Baqi (a.s.)",
  "data": "Ziyarat of the Four Imams (a.s.)\nBefore the ziyarat, do ghusl, put on clean clothes and perfume, as in [Etiquettes of Ziyarat](B3). At the gate, ask permission to enter:\nيَا مَوَالِيَّ يَاۤ اَبْنَاۤءَ رَسُوْلِ اللّٰهِ\nYAA MAWAALIYYA YAA ABNAA'A RASOOLILLAAH\nO my masters, sons of the Messenger of Allah,\nعَبْدُكُمْ وَابْنُ اَمَتِكُمُ\nA'BDUKUM WABNU AMATIKUM\nI, your servant and the son of your maid,\nالذَّلِيْلُ بَيْنَ اَيْدِيْكُمْ\nADH-DHALEELU BAYNA AYDEEKUM\nwho stand submissively before you,\nوَالْمُضْعَفُ فِي عُلُوِّ قَدْرِكُمْ\nWAL MUD'AFU FEE U'LUWWI QADRIKUM\nwho is worth nothing in comparison with your elevated esteem,\nوَالْمُعْتَرِفُ بِحَقِّكُمْ\nWAL MU'TARIFU BIHAQQIKUM\nand who admits your right (that is incumbent upon us)\nجَاۤءَكُمْ مُسْتَجِيْرًا بِكُمْ\nJAA'AKUM MUSTAJEERAN BIKUM\nhave come to you, seeking your shelter,\nقَاصِدًا اِلٰى حَرَمِكُمْ\nQAASIDAN ILAA HARAMIKUM\nheading for your sanctuary,\nمُتَقَرِّبًا اِلٰى مَقَامِكُمْ\nMUTAQARRIBAN ILAA MAQAAMIKUM\nseeking nearness to Your statuses,\nمُتَوَسِّلًا اِلَى اللّٰهِ تَعَالٰى بِكُمْ\nMUTAWASSILAN ILALLAAHI TA'AALAA BIKUM\nand beseeching Allah in your names.\nءَاَدْخُلُ يَا مَوَالِيَّ\nA'ADKHULU YAA MAWAALIYY\nMay I enter, O my masters?\nءَاَدْخُلُ يَا اَوْلِيَاۤءَ اللّٰهِ\nA'ADKHULU YAA AWLIYAA'ALLAAH\nMay I enter, O intimate servants of Allah?\nءَاَدْخُلُ يَا مَلَاۤئِكَةَ اللّٰهِ الْمُحْدِقِيْنَ بِهٰذَا الْحَرَمِ\nA'ADKHULU YAA MALAA'IKATALLAAHIL MUHDIQEENA BIHAADHAL HARAM\nMay I enter, O Allah’s angels who surround this sanctuary\nالْمُقِيْمِيْنَ بِهٰذَا الْمَشْهَدِ\nAL-MUQEEMEENA BIHAADHAL MASH-HAD\nand reside in this shrine?\nOnce you feel humble and tender-hearted, enter with your right foot and say:\nاَللّٰهُ اَكْبَرُ كَبِيْرًا\nALLAAHU AKBARU KABEERAA\nAllah is greatly the Greatest.\nوَالْحَمْدُ لِلّٰهِ كَثِيْرًا\nWAL HAMDU LILLAAHI KATHEERAA\nAll praise be to Allah abundantly.\nوَسُبْحَانَ اللّٰهِ بُكْرَةً وَاَصِيْلًا\nWA SUBHAANALLAAHI BUKRATAN WA ASEELAA\nGlory be to Allah in morns and eves.\nوَالْحَمْدُ لِلّٰهِ الْفَرْدِ الصَّمَدِ\nWAL HAMDU LILLAAHIL FARDIS SAMAD\nAll praise be to Allah, the Single, the Absolute,\nالْمَاجِدِ الْاَحَدِ\nAL-MAAJIDIL AHAD\nthe Glorious, the One and Only,\nالْمُتَفَضِّلِ الْمَنَّانِ\nAL-MUTAFADDILIL MANNAAN\nthe All-obliging, the All-benefactor,\nالْمُتَطَوِّلِ الْحَنَّانِ\nAL-MUTATAWWILIL HANNAAN\nthe Donor, the All-compassionate,\nالَّذِيْ مَنَّ بِطَوْلِهٖ\nALLADHEE MANNA BITAWLIH\nWho conferred (upon us) with His bequests,\nوَسَهَّلَ زِيَارَةَ سَادَاتِيْ بِاِحْسَانِهٖ\nWA SAHHALA ZIYAARATA SAADAATEE BI-IHSAANIH\nWho has made easy for me to visit my masters out of His beneficence,\nوَلَمْ يَجْعَلْنِيْ عَنْ زِيَارَتِهِمْ مَمْنُوْعًا\nWA LAM YAJ'ALNEE A'N ZIYAARATIHIM MAMNOO'AA\nWho has not included me with those who are prevented from visiting them;\nبَلْ تَطَوَّلَ وَمَنَحَ\nBAL TATAWWALA WA MANAH\nrather, He has bestowed upon me and donated me (this favor).\nGo to their graves and stand facing them, your back to the qiblah:\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكُمْ اَئِمَّةَ الْهُدٰى\nAS-SALAAMU A'LAYKUM A'IMMATAL HUDAA\nPeace be upon you, O Leaders of true guidance.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكُمْ اَهْلَ التَّقْوٰى\nAS-SALAAMU A'LAYKUM AHLAT TAQWAA\nPeace be upon you, O people of piety.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكُمْ اَيُّهَا الْحُجَجُ عَلٰۤى اَهْلِ الدُّنْيَا\nAS-SALAAMU A'LAYKUM AYYUHAL HUJAJU A'LAA AHLID DUNYAA\nPeace be upon you, O Arguments against the inhabitants of this world.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكُمْ اَيُّهَا الْقُوَّامُ فِي الْبَرِيَّةِ بِالْقِسْطِ\nAS-SALAAMU A'LAYKUM AYYUHAL QUWWAAMU FIL BARIYYATI BIL QIST\nPeace be upon you, O maintainers of justice on people.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكُمْ اَهْلَ الصَّفْوَةِ\nAS-SALAAMU A'LAYKUM AHLAS SAFWAH\nPeace be upon you, O choicest people.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكُمْ اٰلَ رَسُوْلِ اللّٰهِ\nAS-SALAAMU A'LAYKUM AALA RASOOLILLAAH\nPeace be upon you, O members of the Household of Allah’s Messenger.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكُمْ اَهْلَ النَّجْوٰى\nAS-SALAAMU A'LAYKUM AHLAN NAJWAA\nPeace be upon you, O people of confidential talks (of the angels).\nاَشْهَدُ اَنَّكُمْ قَدْ بَلَّغْتُمْ وَنَصَحْتُمْ\nASH-HADU ANNAKUM QAD BALLAGHTUM WA NASAHTUM\nI bear witness that you did convey, offer advice,\nوَصَبَرْتُمْ فِيْ ذَاتِ اللّٰهِ\nWA SABARTUM FEE DHAATILLAAH\nendure for the sake of Allah,\nوَكُذِّبْتُمْ وَاُسِيْءَ اِلَيْكُمْ فَغَفَرْتُمْ\nWA KUDHDHIBTUM WA USEE'A ILAYKUM FAGHAFARTUM\nand forgive when you were belied and maltreated.\nوَاَشْهَدُ اَنَّكُمُ الْاَئِمَّةُ الرَّاشِدُوْنَ الْمُهْتَدُوْنَ\nWA ASH-HADU ANNAKUMUL A'IMMATUR RAASHIDOONAL MUHTADOON\nI also bear witness that you are the orthodox, well-guided Leaders,\nوَاَنَّ طَاعَتَكُمْ مَفْرُوْضَةٌ\nWA ANNA TAA'ATAKUM MAFROODAH\nthat the obedience to you is obligatory,\nوَاَنَّ قَوْلَكُمُ الصِّدْقُ\nWA ANNA QAWLAKUMUS SIDQ\nthat your words are true,\nوَاَنَّكُمْ دَعَوْتُمْ فَلَمْ تُجَابُوْا\nWA ANNAKUM DA'AWTUM FALAM TUJAABOO\nthat you had called (to Allah) but you were not answered,\nوَاَمَرْتُمْ فَلَمْ تُطَاعُوْا\nWA AMARTUM FALAM TUTAA'OO\nthat you had enjoined (the right) but you were not obeyed,\nوَاَنَّكُمْ دَعَاۤئِمُ الدِّيْنِ وَاَرْكَانُ الْاَرْضِ\nWA ANNAKUM DA'AA'IMUD DEENI WA ARKAANUL ARD\nand that you are the supports of the religion and the poses of the earth.\nلَمْ تَزَالُوْا بِعَيْنِ اللّٰهِ\nLAM TAZAALOO BI-A'YNILLAAH\nYou were always under the sight of Allah\nيَنْسَخُكُمْ مِنْ اَصْلَابِ كُلِّ مُطَهَّرٍ\nYANSAKHUKUM MIN ASLAABI KULLI MUTAHHAR\nWho moved you from the loins of purified men\nوَيَنْقُلُكُمْ مِنْ اَرْحَامِ الْمُطَهَّرَاتِ\nWA YANQULUKUM MIN ARHAAMIL MUTAHHARAAT\nto the wombs of purified women.\nلَمْ تُدَنِّسْكُمُ الْجَاهِلِيَّةُ الْجَهْلَاۤءُ\nLAM TUDANNISKUMUL JAAHILIYYATUL JAHLAA'\nThe benighted ignorance could not stain you\nوَلَمْ تَشْرَكْ فِيْكُمْ فِتَنُ الْاَهْوَاۤءِ\nWA LAM TASHRAK FEEKUM FITANUL AHWAA'\nand the whimsical sedition could not attract you.\nطِبْتُمْ وَطَابَ مَنْبَتُكُمْ\nTIBTUM WA TAABA MANBATUKUM\nPleased be you as your origin has been pleased.\nمَنَّ بِكُمْ عَلَيْنَا دَيَّانُ الدِّيْنِ\nMANNA BIKUM A'LAYNAA DAYYAANUD DEEN\nThe King of the religion has conferred upon us with the grace of our acknowledgment of you;\nفَجَعَلَكُمْ فِيْ بُيُوْتٍ\nFAJA'ALAKUM FEE BUYOOT\nHe therefore caused you to be in houses\nاَذِنَ اللّٰهُ اَنْ تُرْفَعَ\nADHINALLAAHU AN TURFA'\nwhich He (i.e. Allah) has permitted to be exalted\nوَيُذْكَرَ فِيْهَا اسْمُهٗ\nWA YUDHKARA FEEHAS MUH\nand that His Name may be mentioned therein,\nوَجَعَلَ صَلٰوتَنَا عَلَيْكُمْ\nWA JA'ALA SALAATANAA A'LAYKUM\nand He has decided our invocations of blessings upon you\nرَحْمَةً لَنَا وَكَفَّارَةً لِذُنُوْبِنَا\nRAHMATAN LANAA WA KAFFAARATAN LIDHUNOOBINAA\nto be mercy on us and to be granting remission of our sins.\nاِذِ اخْتَارَكُمُ اللّٰهُ لَنَا\nIDHIKH TAARAKUMULLAAHU LANAA\nAllah has chosen you for us\nوَطَيَّبَ خَلْقَنَا بِمَا مَنَّ عَلَيْنَا مِنْ وِلَايَتِكُمْ\nWA TAYYABA KHALQANAA BIMAA MANNA A'LAYNAA MIN WILAAYATIKUM\nand has purified our creation through the grace of our loyalty to your (Divinely commissioned) Leadership with which He has conferred upon us.\nوَكُنَّا عِنْدَهٗ مُسَمِّيْنَ بِعِلْمِكُمْ\nWA KUNNAA I'NDAHOO MUSAMMEENA BI-I'LMIKUM\nWe have thus become nominated with Him due to our acknowledgement of you\nمُعْتَرِفِيْنَ بِتَصْدِيْقِنَا اِيَّاكُمْ\nMU'TARIFEENA BITASDEEQINAA IYYAAKUM\nand our giving credence to you.\nوَهٰذَا مَقَامُ مَنْ اَسْرَفَ وَاَخْطَاَ\nWA HAADHAA MAQAAMU MAN ASRAFA WA AKHTA'\nSo, this is the situation of him who has committed mistakes and sins,\nوَاسْتَكَانَ وَاَقَرَّ بِمَا جَنٰى\nWASTAKAANA WA AQARRA BIMAA JANAA\nshown submission (to you), and confessed of what he had committed.\nوَرَجَا بِمَقَامِهِ الْخَلَاصَ\nWA RAJAA BIMAQAAMIHIL KHALAAS\nHence, being in this situation, I hope for redemption\nوَاَنْ يَسْتَنْقِذَهٗ بِكُمْ مُسْتَنْقِذُ الْهَلْكٰى مِنَ الرَّدٰى\nWA AN YASTANQIDHAHOO BIKUM MUSTANQIDHUL HALKAA MINAR RADAA\nand I hope that the Savior of the perishing ones from perdition may save me in your names.\nفَكُوْنُوْا لِيْ شُفَعَاۤءَ\nFAKOONOO LEE SHUFA'AA'\nSo, (please) be my interceders,\nفَقَدْ وَفَدْتُ اِلَيْكُمْ\nFAQAD WAFADTU ILAYKUM\nfor I have come to you\nاِذْ رَغِبَ عَنْكُمْ اَهْلُ الدُّنْيَا\nIDH RAGHIBA A'NKUM AHLUD DUNYAA\nwhen the people of this world abandoned you,\nوَاتَّخَذُوْا اٰيَاتِ اللّٰهِ هُزُوًا\nWATTAKHADHOO AAYAATILLAAHI HUZUWAA\ntook the Signs of Allah for a jest,\nوَاسْتَكْبَرُوْا عَنْهَا\nWASTAKBAROO A'NHAA\nand turned away from them haughtily.\nThen raise your head toward the sky and say:\nيَا مَنْ هُوَ قَاۤئِمٌ لَا يَسْهُوْ\nYAA MAN HUWA QAA'IMUN LAA YAS-HOO\nO He Who is Self-Subsisting and never forgets,\nوَدَاۤئِمٌ لَا يَلْهُوْ\nWA DAA'IMUN LAA YALHOO\nWho is Ever-living and never becomes heedless,\nوَمُحِيْطٌ بِكُلِّ شَيْءٍ\nWA MUHEETUN BIKULLI SHAY'\nand Who encompasses all things!\nلَكَ الْمَنُّ بِمَا وَفَّقْتَنِيْ\nLAKAL MANNU BIMAA WAFFAQTANEE\nTo You is all gratitude for that You have guided me (to this)\nوَعَرَّفْتَنِيْ بِمَاۤ اَقَمْتَنِيْ عَلَيْهِ\nWA A'RRAFTANEE BIMAA AQAMTANEE A'LAYH\nand You have introduced to me that on which I rest,\nاِذْ صَدَّ عَنْهُ عِبَادُكَ\nIDH SADDA A'NHU I'BAADUK\nwhen Your servants diverted from it,\nوَجَهِلُوْا مَعْرِفَتَهٗ\nWA JAHILOO MA'RIFATAH\nignored the recognition of it,\nوَاسْتَخَفُّوْا بِحَقِّهٖ\nWASTAKHAFFOO BIHAQQIH\nbelittled its right,\nوَمَالُوْا اِلٰى سِوَاهُ\nWA MAALOO ILAA SIWAAH\nand inclined to elsewhere.\nفَكَانَتِ الْمِنَّةُ مِنْكَ عَلَيَّ\nFAKAANATIL MINNATU MINKA A'LAYY\nHence, You have conferred upon me with this favor\nمَعَ اَقْوَامٍ خَصَصْتَهُمْ بِمَا خَصَصْتَنِيْ بِهٖ\nMA'A AQWAAMIN KHASASTAHUM BIMAA KHASASTANEE BIH\nas well as upon other people whom You have granted exclusively the same.\nفَلَكَ الْحَمْدُ اِذْ كُنْتُ عِنْدَكَ\nFALAKAL HAMDU IDH KUNTU I'NDAK\nSo, all praise be to You, for I have been\nفِيْ مَقَامِيْ هٰذَا مَذْكُوْرًا مَكْتُوْبًا\nFEE MAQAAMEE HAADHAA MADHKOORAN MAKTOOBAA\nmentioned and written with You due to the situation in which I am now.\nفَلَا تَحْرِمْنِيْ مَا رَجَوْتُ\nFALAA TAHRIMNEE MAA RAJAWT\nHence, (please) do not deprive me of what I long for,\nوَلَا تُخَيِّبْنِيْ فِيْمَا دَعَوْتُ\nWA LAA TUKHAYYIBNEE FEEMAA DA'AWT\nand do not disappoint me as regards my supplication;\nبِحُرْمَةِ مُحَمَّدٍ وَاٰلِهِ الطَّاهِرِيْنَ\nBIHURMATI MUHAMMADIN WA AALIHIT TAAHIREEN\n(please do so) in the name of the sanctity of Muhammad and his immaculate Household.\nوَصَلَّى اللّٰهُ عَلٰى مُحَمَّدٍ وَاٰلِ مُحَمَّدٍ\nWA SALLALLAAHU A'LAA MUHAMMADIN WA AALI MUHAMMAD\nMay Allah send blessings upon Muhammad and the Household of Muhammad.\nThen ask Allah for whatever you need.\nPray the ziyarat prayer: eight units, two for each of the four Imams.",
  "tabs": [
    "Farewell to the Four Imams (a.s.)\nWhen you are leaving, bid the Imams farewell:\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكُمْ اَئِمَّةَ الْهُدٰى وَرَحْمَةُ اللّٰهِ وَبَرَكَاتُهٗ\nAS-SALAAMU A'LAYKUM A'IMMATAL HUDAA WA RAHMATULLAAHI WA BARAKAATUH\nPeace and Allah’s mercy and blessings be upon you, O leaders to the true guidance.\nاَسْتَوْدِعُكُمُ اللّٰهَ وَاَقْرَاُ عَلَيْكُمُ السَّلَامَ\nASTAWDI'UKUMULLAAHA WA AQRA'U A'LAYKUMUS SALAAM\nI entrust you with Allah and send salutations to you.\nاٰمَنَّا بِاللّٰهِ وَبِالرَّسُوْلِ\nAAMANNAA BILLAAHI WA BIR RASOOL\nWe believe in Allah and in the Messenger\nوَبِمَا جِئْتُمْ بِهٖ وَدَلَلْتُمْ عَلَيْهِ\nWA BIMAA JI'TUM BIHEE WA DALALTUM A'LAYH\nand in that which you have conveyed and that to which you have guided.\nاَللّٰهُمَّ فَاكْتُبْنَا مَعَ الشَّاهِدِيْنَ\nALLAAHUMMA FAKTUBNAA MA'ASH SHAAHIDEEN\nO Allah, then write us down among those who bear witness.\nThen pray as earnestly as you can, and ask Allah to let you visit them again.",
    "Ibrahim, Son of the Prophet (s.a.w.a.)\nStand at the grave of Ibrahim, son of the Holy Prophet (s.a.w.a.), and say:\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلٰى رَسُوْلِ اللّٰهِ اَلسَّلَامُ عَلٰى نَبِيِّ اللّٰهِ\nAS-SALAAMU A'LAA RASOOLILLAAHIS SALAAMU A'LAA NABIYYILLAAH\nPeace be upon Allah’s messenger. Peace be upon Allah’s prophet.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلٰى حَبِيْبِ اللّٰهِ اَلسَّلَامُ عَلٰى صَفِيِّ اللّٰهِ\nAS-SALAAMU A'LAA HABEEBILLAAHIS SALAAMU A'LAA SAFIYYILLAAH\nPeace be upon Allah’s elite. Peace be upon Allah’s well-selected one.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلٰى نَجِيِّ اللّٰهِ\nAS-SALAAMU A'LAA NAJIYYILLAAH\nPeace be upon Allah’s confidant.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلٰى مُحَمَّدِ بْنِ عَبْدِ اللّٰهِ سَيِّدِ الْاَنْبِيَاۤءِ وَخَاتَمِ الْمُرْسَلِيْنَ\nAS-SALAAMU A'LAA MUHAMMADIBNI A'BDILLAAHI SAYYIDIL ANBIYAA'I WA KHAATAMIL MURSALEEN\nPeace be upon Muhammad the son of ’Abdullah, the master of the Prophets, the seal of the Messengers,\nوَخِيَرَةِ اللّٰهِ مِنْ خَلْقِهٖ فِيْۤ اَرْضِهٖ وَسَمَاۤئِهٖ\nWA KHIYARATILLAAHI MIN KHALQIHEE FEE ARDIHEE WA SAMAA'IH\nand the best of Allah’s created beings in the earth and the skies.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلٰى جَمِيْعِ اَنْبِيَاۤئِهٖ وَرُسُلِهٖ\nAS-SALAAMU A'LAA JAMEE'I ANBIYAA'IHEE WA RUSULIH\nPeace be upon all His Prophets and Messengers.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَى الشُّهَدَاۤءِ وَالسُّعَدَاۤءِ وَالصَّالِحِيْنَ\nAS-SALAAMU A'LASH SHUHADAA'I WAS SU'ADAA'I WAS SAALIHEEN\nPeace be upon the martyrs, the happy ones, and the righteous ones.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْنَا وَعَلٰى عِبَادِ اللّٰهِ الصَّالِحِيْنَ\nAS-SALAAMU A'LAYNAA WA A'LAA I'BAADILLAAHIS SAALIHEEN\nPeace be upon us and upon the righteous servants of Allah.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ اَيَّتُهَا الرُّوْحُ الزَّاكِيَةُ\nAS-SALAAMU A'LAYKA AYYATUHAR ROOHUZ ZAAKIYAH\nPeace be upon you, O pure soul.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ اَيَّتُهَا النَّفْسُ الشَّرِيْفَةُ\nAS-SALAAMU A'LAYKA AYYATUHAN NAFSUSH SHAREEFAH\nPeace be upon you, O honorable self.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ اَيَّتُهَا السُّلَالَةُ الطَّاهِرَةُ\nAS-SALAAMU A'LAYKA AYYATUHAS SULAALATUT TAAHIRAH\nPeace be upon you, O immaculate descendant.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ اَيَّتُهَا النَّسَمَةُ الزَّاكِيَةُ\nAS-SALAAMU A'LAYKA AYYATUHAN NASAMATUZ ZAAKIYAH\nPeace be upon you, O upright person.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ يَا ابْنَ خَيْرِ الْوَرٰى\nAS-SALAAMU A'LAYKA YABNA KHAYRIL WARAA\nPeace be upon you, O son of the best of all created beings.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ يَا ابْنَ النَّبِيِّ الْمُجْتَبٰى\nAS-SALAAMU A'LAYKA YABNAN NABIYYIL MUJTABAA\nPeace be upon you, O son of the selected Prophet.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ يَا ابْنَ الْمَبْعُوْثِ اِلٰى كَآفَّةِ الْوَرٰى\nAS-SALAAMU A'LAYKA YABNAL MAB'OOTHI ILAA KAAFFATIL WARAA\nPeace be upon you, O son of the envoy to all peoples.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ يَا ابْنَ الْبَشِيْرِ النَّذِيْرِ\nAS-SALAAMU A'LAYKA YABNAL BASHEERIN NADHEER\nPeace be upon you, O son of the conveyor of good tidings (to the believers) and the warner (against Allah’s chastisement).\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ يَا ابْنَ السِّرَاجِ الْمُنِيْرِ\nAS-SALAAMU A'LAYKA YABNAS SIRAAJIL MUNEER\nPeace be upon you, O son of the bright torch.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ يَا ابْنَ الْمُؤَيَّدِ بِالْقُرْاٰنِ\nAS-SALAAMU A'LAYKA YABNAL MU'AYYADI BIL QUR'AAN\nPeace be upon you, O son of the one supported by the Qur’an.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ يَا ابْنَ الْمُرْسَلِ اِلَى الْاِنْسِ وَالْجَآنِّ\nAS-SALAAMU A'LAYKA YABNAL MURSALI ILAL INSI WAL JAANN\nPeace be upon you, O son of the one sent to both men and jinn.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ يَا ابْنَ صَاحِبِ الرَّايَةِ وَالْعَلَامَةِ\nAS-SALAAMU A'LAYKA YABNA SAAHIBIR RAAYATI WAL A'LAAMAH\nPeace be upon you, O son of the holder of the Pennon and the Sign.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ يَا ابْنَ الشَّفِيْعِ يَوْمَ الْقِيَامَةِ\nAS-SALAAMU A'LAYKA YABNASH SHAFEE'I YAWMAL QIYAAMAH\nPeace be upon you, O son of the intercessor on the Resurrection Day.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ يَا ابْنَ مَنْ حَبَاهُ اللّٰهُ بِالْكَرَامَةِ\nAS-SALAAMU A'LAYKA YABNA MAN HABAAHULLAAHU BIL KARAAMAH\nPeace be upon you, O son of him upon whom Allah has conferred honor.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ وَرَحْمَةُ اللّٰهِ وَبَرَكَاتُهٗ\nAS-SALAAMU A'LAYKA WA RAHMATULLAAHI WA BARAKAATUH\nPeace and Allah’s mercy and blessings be upon you.\nاَشْهَدُ اَنَّكَ قَدِ اخْتَارَ اللّٰهُ لَكَ دَارَ اِنْعَامِهٖ\nASH-HADU ANNAKA QADIKH TAARALLAAHU LAKA DAARA IN'AAMIH\nI bear witness that Allah decided for you the abode of His bliss\nقَبْلَ اَنْ يَكْتُبَ عَلَيْكَ اَحْكَامَهٗ اَوْ يُكَلِّفَكَ حَلَالَهٗ وَحَرَامَهٗ\nQABLA AN YAKTUBA A'LAYKA AHKAAMAHOO AW YUKALLIFAKA HALAALAHOO WA HARAAMAH\nbefore He prescribed His rules for you or ordained you to commit to what is deemed lawful and what is deemed unlawful by Him.\nفَنَقَلَكَ اِلَيْهِ طَيِّبًا زَاكِيًا مَرْضِيًّا طَاهِرًا\nFANAQALAKA ILAYHI TAYYIBAN ZAAKIYAN MARDIYYAN TAAHIRAA\nHe thus moved you near Him while you are immaculate, upright, pleased, purified\nمِنْ كُلِّ نَجَسٍ مُقَدَّسًا مِنْ كُلِّ دَنَسٍ\nMIN KULLI NAJASIN MUQADDASAN MIN KULLI DANAS\nfrom all filths, and sanctified against all dirt.\nوَبَوَّاَكَ جَنَّةَ الْمَاْوٰى وَرَفَعَكَ اِلَى الدَّرَجَاتِ الْعُلٰى\nWA BAWWA'AKA JANNATAL MA'WAA WA RAFA'AKA ILAD DARAJAATIL U'LAA\nHe lodged you in the Paradisiacal Abode and elevated you to the uppermost ranks.\nوَصَلَّى اللّٰهُ عَلَيْكَ صَلٰوةً تَقَرُّ بِهَا عَيْنُ رَسُوْلِهٖ\nWA SALLALLAAHU A'LAYKA SALAATAN TAQARRU BIHAA A'YNU RASOOLIH\nMay Allah bless you with such blessings that delight His Messenger\nوَتُبَلِّغُهٗ اَكْبَرَ مَاْمُوْلِهٖ\nWA TUBALLIGHUHOO AKBARA MA'MOOLIH\nand make him attain his utmost objective.\nاَللّٰهُمَّ اجْعَلْ اَفْضَلَ صَلَوَاتِكَ وَاَزْكَاهَا\nALLAAHUMMAJ A'L AFDALA SALAWAATIKA WA AZKAAHAA\nO Allah, (please do) render the best and the purest of Your blessings,\nوَاَنْمٰى بَرَكَاتِكَ وَاَوْفَاهَا عَلٰى رَسُوْلِكَ وَنَبِيِّكَ\nWA ANMAA BARAKAATIKA WA AWFAAHAA A'LAA RASOOLIKA WA NABIYYIK\nand the most abundant and richest of Your benedictions to be upon Your messenger, prophet,\nوَخِيَرَتِكَ مِنْ خَلْقِكَ مُحَمَّدٍ خَاتَمِ النَّبِيِّيْنَ\nWA KHIYARATIKA MIN KHALQIKA MUHAMMADIN KHAATAMIN NABIYYEEN\nand the most favorite of Your creatures; namely, Muhammad, the seal of the prophets,\nوَعَلٰى مَنْ نَسَلَ مِنْ اَوْلَادِهِ الطَّيِّبِيْنَ\nWA A'LAA MAN NASALA MIN AWLAADIHIT TAYYIBEEN\nand upon his immaculate sons,\nوَعَلٰى مَنْ خَلَّفَ مِنْ عِتْرَتِهِ الطَّاهِرِيْنَ\nWA A'LAA MAN KHALLAFA MIN I'TRATIHIT TAAHIREEN\nand upon his pure successors from his household;\nبِرَحْمَتِكَ يَاۤ اَرْحَمَ الرَّاحِمِيْنَ\nBIRAHMATIKA YAA ARHAMAR RAAHIMEEN\nin the name of Your mercy, O most merciful of all those who show mercy.\nاَللّٰهُمَّ اِنِّيْۤ اَسْاَلُكَ بِحَقِّ مُحَمَّدٍ صَفِيِّكَ\nALLAAHUMMA INNEE AS'ALUKA BIHAQQI MUHAMMADIN SAFIYYIK\nO Allah, I beseech You in the name of Muhammad, Your elite,\nوَاِبْرَاهِيْمَ نَجْلِ نَبِيِّكَ اَنْ تَجْعَلَ سَعْيِيْ بِهِمْ مَشْكُوْرًا\nWA IBRAAHEEMA NAJLI NABIYYIKA AN TAJ'ALA SA'YEE BIHIM MASHKOORAA\nand in the name of Ibrahim, the son of Your prophet, to make my efforts to be praiseworthy,\nوَذَنْبِيْ بِهِمْ مَغْفُوْرًا وَحَيَاتِيْ بِهِمْ سَعِيْدَةً\nWA DHANBEE BIHIM MAGHFOORAN WA HAYAATEE BIHIM SA'EEDAH\nmy sins forgiven, my life satisfying,\nوَعَاقِبَتِيْ بِهِمْ حَمِيْدَةً وَحَوَاۤئِجِيْ بِهِمْ مَقْضِيَّةً\nWA A'AQIBATEE BIHIM HAMEEDATAN WA HAWAA'IJEE BIHIM MAQDIYYAH\nmy end result commendable, my needs settled,\nوَاَفْعَالِيْ بِهِمْ مَرْضِيَّةً وَاُمُوْرِيْ بِهِمْ مَسْعُوْدَةً\nWA AF'AALEE BIHIM MARDIYYATAN WA UMOOREE BIHIM MAS'OODAH\nmy deeds pleased, my affairs blissful,\nوَشُئُوْنِيْ بِهِمْ مَحْمُوْدَةً\nWA SHU'OONEE BIHIM MAHMOODAH\nand my matters commended.\nاَللّٰهُمَّ وَاَحْسِنْ لِيَ التَّوْفِيْقَ\nALLAAHUMMA WA AHSIN LIYAT TAWFEEQ\nO Allah, (please do) grant me remarkable successfulness\nوَنَفِّسْ عَنِّيْ كُلَّ هَمٍّ وَضِيْقٍ\nWA NAFFIS A'NNEE KULLA HAMMIN WA DEEQ\nand relieve me from all of my grievances and depressions.\nاَللّٰهُمَّ جَنِّبْنِيْ عِقَابَكَ\nALLAAHUMMA JANNIBNEE I'QAABAK\nO Allah, (please do) ward off from me Your chastisement,\nوَامْنَحْنِيْ ثَوَابَكَ وَاَسْكِنِّيْ جِنَانَكَ\nWAMNAHNEE THAWAABAKA WA ASKINNEE JINAANAK\nsign over me Your rewards, allow me to settle in the gardens of Your Paradise,\nوَارْزُقْنِيْ رِضْوَانَكَ وَاَمَانَكَ\nWARZUQNEE RIDWAANAKA WA AMAANAK\nbestow upon me Your pleasure and security,\nوَاَشْرِكْ لِيْ فِيْ صَالِحِ دُعَاۤئِيْ وَالِدَيَّ وَوُلْدِيْ\nWA ASHRIK LEE FEE SAALIHI DU'AA'EE WAALIDAYYA WA WULDEE\nand allow my acceptable supplications to include my parents, my sons,\nوَجَمِيْعَ الْمُؤْمِنِيْنَ وَالْمُؤْمِنَاتِ\nWA JAMEE'AL MU'MINEENA WAL MU'MINAAT\nand all believing men and women,\nالْاَحْيَاۤءَ مِنْهُمْ وَالْاَمْوَاتَ\nAL-AHYAA'A MINHUM WAL AMWAAT\nthe alive and the dead,\nاِنَّكَ وَلِيُّ الْبَاقِيَاتِ الصَّالِحَاتِ\nINNAKA WALIYYUL BAAQIYAATIS SAALIHAAT\nfor You are verily the Lord of the ever-abiding, good works.\nاٰمِيْنَ رَبَّ الْعَالَمِيْنَ\nAAMEENA RABBAL A'ALAMEEN\nRespond to me, O Lord of the Worlds.\nThen ask Allah for your needs, and pray two units.",
    "Lady Fatimah bint Asad (s.a.)\nStand at the grave of Lady Fatimah bint Asad (s.a.), mother of Amir al-Mu'minin (a.s.), and say:\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلٰى نَبِيِّ اللّٰهِ اَلسَّلَامُ عَلٰى رَسُوْلِ اللّٰهِ\nAS-SALAAMU A'LAA NABIYYILLAAHIS SALAAMU A'LAA RASOOLILLAAH\nPeace be upon Allah’s Prophet. Peace be upon Allah’s Messenger.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلٰى مُحَمَّدٍ سَيِّدِ الْمُرْسَلِيْنَ\nAS-SALAAMU A'LAA MUHAMMADIN SAYYIDIL MURSALEEN\nPeace be upon Muhammad, the chief of the Messengers.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلٰى مُحَمَّدٍ سَيِّدِ الْاَوَّلِيْنَ\nAS-SALAAMU A'LAA MUHAMMADIN SAYYIDIL AWWALEEN\nPeace be upon Muhammad, the chief of the past generations.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلٰى مُحَمَّدٍ سَيِّدِ الْاٰخِرِيْنَ\nAS-SALAAMU A'LAA MUHAMMADIN SAYYIDIL AAKHIREEN\nPeace be upon Muhammad, the chief of the coming generations.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلٰى مَنْ بَعَثَهُ اللّٰهُ رَحْمَةً لِلْعَالَمِيْنَ\nAS-SALAAMU A'LAA MAN BA'ATHAHULLAAHU RAHMATAN LIL A'ALAMEEN\nPeace be upon him whom Allah has sent as mercy for the peoples.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ اَيُّهَا النَّبِيُّ وَرَحْمَةُ اللّٰهِ وَبَرَكَاتُهٗ\nAS-SALAAMU A'LAYKA AYYUHAN NABIYYU WA RAHMATULLAAHI WA BARAKAATUH\nPeace and Allah’s mercy and blessings be upon you, O Prophet.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلٰى فَاطِمَةَ بِنْتِ اَسَدٍ الْهَاشِمِيَّةِ\nAS-SALAAMU A'LAA FAATIMATA BINTI ASADINIL HAASHIMIYYAH\nPeace be upon Fatimah the daughter of Asad, the Hashemite lady.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكِ اَيَّتُهَا الصِّدِّيْقَةُ الْمَرْضِيَّةُ\nAS-SALAAMU A'LAYKI AYYATUHAS SIDDEEQATUL MARDIYYAH\nPeace be upon you, O veracious and well-pleased.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكِ اَيَّتُهَا التَّقِيَّةُ النَّقِيَّةُ\nAS-SALAAMU A'LAYKI AYYATUHAT TAQIYYATUN NAQIYYAH\nPeace be upon you, O pious and pure.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكِ اَيَّتُهَا الْكَرِيْمَةُ الرَّضِيَّةُ\nAS-SALAAMU A'LAYKI AYYATUHAL KAREEMATUR RADIYYAH\nPeace be upon you, O noble and pleased.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكِ يَا كَافِلَةَ مُحَمَّدٍ خَاتَمِ النَّبِيِّيْنَ\nAS-SALAAMU A'LAYKI YAA KAAFILATA MUHAMMADIN KHAATAMIN NABIYYEEN\nPeace be upon you, O nurse of Muhammad, the seal of the Prophets.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكِ يَا وَالِدَةَ سَيِّدِ الْوَصِيِّيْنَ\nAS-SALAAMU A'LAYKI YAA WAALIDATA SAYYIDIL WASIYYEEN\nPeace be upon you, O mother of the chief of the Prophets’ successors.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكِ يَا مَنْ ظَهَرَتْ شَفَقَتُهَا عَلٰى رَسُوْلِ اللّٰهِ خَاتَمِ النَّبِيِّيْنَ\nAS-SALAAMU A'LAYKI YAA MAN ZAHARAT SHAFAQATUHAA A'LAA RASOOLILLAAHI KHAATAMIN NABIYYEEN\nPeace be upon you, O she who showed compassion to Allah’s Messenger, the seal of the Prophets.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكِ يَا مَنْ تَرْبِيَتُهَا لِوَلِيِّ اللّٰهِ الْاَمِيْنِ\nAS-SALAAMU A'LAYKI YAA MAN TARBIYATUHAA LIWALIYYILLAAHIL AMEEN\nPeace be upon you, O she who reared the honest representative of Allah.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكِ وَعَلٰى رُوْحِكِ وَبَدَنِكِ الطَّاهِرِ\nAS-SALAAMU A'LAYKI WA A'LAA ROOHIKI WA BADANIKIT TAAHIR\nPeace be upon you and upon your soul and pure body.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكِ وَعَلٰى وَلَدِكِ وَرَحْمَةُ اللّٰهِ وَبَرَكَاتُهٗ\nAS-SALAAMU A'LAYKI WA A'LAA WALADIKI WA RAHMATULLAAHI WA BARAKAATUH\nPeace and Allah’s mercy and blessings be upon you and your son.\nاَشْهَدُ اَنَّكِ اَحْسَنْتِ الْكِفَالَةَ وَاَدَّيْتِ الْاَمَانَةَ\nASH-HADU ANNAKI AHSANTIL KIFAALATA WA ADDAYTIL AMAANAH\nI bear witness that you did well when you nursed the Prophet, fulfilled your duty,\nوَاجْتَهَدْتِ فِيْ مَرْضَاةِ اللّٰهِ\nWAJTAHADTI FEE MARDAATILLAAH\nexerted all efforts for gaining the pleasure of Allah,\nوَبَالَغْتِ فِيْ حِفْظِ رَسُوْلِ اللّٰهِ\nWA BAALAGHTI FEE HIFZI RASOOLILLAAH\nand strove in the safeguarding of Allah’s messenger\nعَارِفَةً بِحَقِّهٖ مُؤْمِنَةً بِصِدْقِهٖ مُعْتَرِفَةً بِنُبُوَّتِهٖ\nA'ARIFATAN BIHAQQIHEE MU'MINATAN BISIDQIHEE MU'TARIFATAN BINUBUWWATIH\nas you acknowledged his actual rank, believed in his honesty, recognized his prophethood,\nمُسْتَبْصِرَةً بِنِعْمَتِهٖ كَافِلَةً بِتَرْبِيَتِهٖ\nMUSTABSIRATAN BINI'MATIHEE KAAFILATAN BITARBIYATIH\nrealized the bliss of him, vouched for taking care of him,\nمُشْفِقَةً عَلٰى نَفْسِهٖ وَاقِفَةً عَلٰى خِدْمَتِهٖ\nMUSHFIQATAN A'LAA NAFSIHEE WAAQIFATAN A'LAA KHIDMATIH\nshowed kindness to him, dedicated all your efforts to serving him,\nمُخْتَارَةً رِضَاهُ\nMUKHTAARATAN RIDAAH\nand decided on what would please him.\nوَاَشْهَدُ اَنَّكِ مَضَيْتِ عَلَى الْاِيْمَانِ\nWA ASH-HADU ANNAKI MADAYTI A'LAL EEMAAN\nI also bear witness that you took up faith\nوَالتَّمَسُّكِ بِاَشْرَفِ الْاَدْيَانِ رَاضِيَةً مَرْضِيَّةً\nWAT TAMASSUKI BI-ASHRAFIL ADYAANI RAADIYATAN MARDIYYAH\nand adhered to the most prominent religion while you are satisfied, pleased,\nطَاهِرَةً زَكِيَّةً تَقِيَّةً نَقِيَّةً فَرَضِيَ اللّٰهُ عَنْكِ\nTAAHIRATAN ZAKIYYATAN TAQIYYATAN NAQIYYATAN FARADIYALLAAHU A'NK\npure, upright, pious, and immaculate. Allah may be pleased with you\nوَاَرْضَاكِ وَجَعَلَ الْجَنَّةَ مَنْزِلَكِ وَمَاْوَاكِ\nWA ARDAAKI WA JA'ALAL JANNATA MANZILAKI WA MA'WAAK\nand may please you. May He decide Paradise to be your eternal abode.\nاَللّٰهُمَّ صَلِّ عَلٰى مُحَمَّدٍ وَاٰلِ مُحَمَّدٍ\nALLAAHUMMA SALLI A'LAA MUHAMMADIN WA AALI MUHAMMAD\nO Allah, (please do) send blessings upon Muhammad and the Household of Muhammad,\nوَانْفَعْنِيْ بِزِيَارَتِهَا وَثَبِّتْنِيْ عَلٰى مَحَبَّتِهَا\nWANFA'NEE BIZIYAARATIHAA WA THABBITNEE A'LAA MAHABBATIHAA\ngrant me advantages on account of my visiting the tomb of her, make me abide by my love for her,\nوَلَا تَحْرِمْنِيْ شَفَاعَتَهَا وَشَفَاعَةَ الْاَئِمَّةِ مِنْ ذُرِّيَّتِهَا\nWA LAA TAHRIMNEE SHAFAA'ATAHAA WA SHAFAA'ATAL A'IMMATI MIN DHURRIYYATIHAA\ndo not deprive me of her intercession and the intercession of the Imams from her offspring,\nوَارْزُقْنِيْ مُرَافَقَتَهَا وَاحْشُرْنِيْ مَعَهَا وَمَعَ اَوْلَادِهَا الطَّاهِرِيْنَ\nWARZUQNEE MURAAFAQATAHAA WAHSHURNEE MA'AHAA WA MA'A AWLAADIHAT TAAHIREEN\ngrant me companionship of her, and include me, on the Resurrection Day, with her group and the group of her immaculate descendants.\nاَللّٰهُمَّ لَا تَجْعَلْهُ اٰخِرَ الْعَهْدِ مِنْ زِيَارَتِيْ اِيَّاهَا\nALLAAHUMMA LAA TAJ'ALHU AAKHIRAL A'HDI MIN ZIYAARATEE IYYAAHAA\nO Allah, (please) do not decide this time of my visiting her tomb to be the last;\nوَارْزُقْنِيْ الْعَوْدَ اِلَيْهَا اَبَدًا مَا اَبْقَيْتَنِيْ\nWARZUQNIL A'WDA ILAYHAA ABADAN MAA ABQAYTANEE\nrather, bestow upon me the favor of returning to visit her tomb as long as You keep me alive,\nوَاِذَا تَوَفَّيْتَنِيْ فَاحْشُرْنِيْ فِيْ زُمْرَتِهَا\nWA IDHAA TAWAFFAYTANEE FAHSHURNEE FEE ZUMRATIHAA\nand, when You grasp my soul, (please) add me to her group,\nوَاَدْخِلْنِيْ فِيْ شَفَاعَتِهَا بِرَحْمَتِكَ يَاۤ اَرْحَمَ الرَّاحِمِيْنَ\nWA ADKHILNEE FEE SHAFAA'ATIHAA BIRAHMATIKA YAA ARHAMAR RAAHIMEEN\nand include me with those for whom she will intercede; (and let all that be) by Your mercy, O most merciful of all those who show mercy.\nاَللّٰهُمَّ بِحَقِّهَا عِنْدَكَ وَمَنْزِلَتِهَا لَدَيْكَ اغْفِرْ لِيْ\nALLAAHUMMA BIHAQQIHAA I'NDAKA WA MANZILATIHAA LADAYKAGH FIR LEE\nO Allah, (I beseech You) in the name of her dignity and position with You, (to) forgive me,\nوَلِوَالِدَيَّ وَلِجَمِيْعِ الْمُؤْمِنِيْنَ وَالْمُؤْمِنَاتِ\nWA LIWAALIDAYYA WA LIJAMEE'IL MU'MINEENA WAL MU'MINAAT\nmy parents, and all believing men and women,\nوَاٰتِنَا فِيْ الدُّنْيَا حَسَنَةً وَفِيْ الْاٰخِرَةِ حَسَنَةً\nWA AATINAA FID DUNYAA HASANATAN WA FIL AAKHIRATI HASANAH\ngrant us good in this world and good in the Hereafter,\nوَقِنَا بِرَحْمَتِكَ عَذَابَ النَّارِ\nWA QINAA BIRAHMATIKA A'DHAABAN NAAR\nand save us, in the name of Your mercy, from the chastisement of Hellfire.\nBefore you leave, pray the two-unit ziyarat prayer, and ask Allah for whatever you want."
  ],
  "merits": "Ziyarat of the Four Imams: the eight-unit ziyarat prayer, two units for each Imam, is from Shaykh al-Tusi's Tahdhib al-Ahkam.\n\nFarewell: Shaykh al-Tusi and Sayyid Ibn Tawus give this farewell.\n\nOther forms: in Bihar al-Anwar, Allamah al-Majlisi cites another, lengthy ziyarat of these four Imams; but the best form of ziyarat, in the words of al-Majlisi and other scholars, is [Ziyarat Jamia Kabira](G13). Imam al-Hasan (a.s.) also has a ziyarat for Mondays, [Ziyarat on Monday](M3), and the other three Imams one for Tuesdays, [Ziyarat on Tuesday](N3).\n\nSalawat: the invocations of blessings upon these Imams are [Salawat upon Imam al-Hasan and Imam al-Husayn (a.s.)](E131), [Salawat upon Imam Zayn al-Abidin (a.s.)](E132), [Salawat upon Imam al-Baqir (a.s.)](E133) and [Salawat upon Imam al-Sadiq (a.s.)](E134).\n\nIbrahim: this ziyarat is given in Misbah al-Za'ir and other books."
}
